 infringement"},{"text":"Digital piracy"},{"text":"Moral rights"},{"text":"Royalty structures"}]},{"type":"h","text":"B. Talent Contracts"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand agreements involving:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Actors"},{"text":"Directors"},{"text":"Writers"},{"text":"Musicians"},{"text":"Singers"},{"text":"Influencers"},{"text":"YouTubers"},{"text":"Content creators"},{"text":"Models"},{"text":"Production professionals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Important clauses include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Scope of services"},{"text":"Compensation"},{"text":"Exclusivity"},{"text":"Term"},{"text":"Territory"},{"text":"Intellectual-property ownership"},{"text":"Confidentiality"},{"text":"Publicity rights"},{"text":"Termination"},{"text":"Morality clauses"},{"text":"Dispute resolution"}]}]},{"heading":"Film & OTT Legal Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong entertainment lawyer should understand the lifecycle of a production."},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"flow","items":["Producer","Story / Script Rights","Writer Agreement","Director Agreement","Actor Agreements","Music Rights","Production Contracts","Copyright Clearance","Distribution Agreement","OTT / Theatre Licensing","Release"]},{"type":"p","text":"The lawyer's role is to identify legal risks before they become expensive disputes."}]},{"heading":"Music Industry Legal Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Artist agreements"},{"text":"Recording agreements"},{"text":"Music licensing"},{"text":"Publishing"},{"text":"Performance rights"},{"text":"Synchronization licensing"},{"text":"Master recordings"},{"text":"Royalty structures"},{"text":"Digital streaming"},{"text":"Music distribution"},{"text":"Sampling rights"},{"text":"Copyright disputes"}]}]},{"heading":"Digital Creator & Influencer Law","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The entertainment industry increasingly includes independent creators."},