ogy Awareness"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Internship Experience"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Practical Contract Portfolio"}]}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile for an aspiring Entertainment Lawyer is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["LL.B.","Copyright/IP","Media & Entertainment Law","Contract Drafting","Licensing","Negotiation","Film/OTT/Music Industry Knowledge","Digital/AI Law","Practical Internships"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The most valuable differentiator is combining strong legal fundamentals with real understanding of how films, OTT platforms, music, talent management and the creator economy actually operate."}]}]}